    "description": "Avolta Renewable Holdings is a renewable natural gas platform focused on dairy projects that capture biogas from manure and upgrade it to pipeline-quality fuel. Its end markets include gas utilities, transportation fuel markets, and environmental credit programs, with cash flows supported by offtake and regulatory value streams tied to low-carbon fuel production. The platform follows an asset-heavy development and ownership model built around digester infrastructure, gas upgrading facilities, and pipeline interconnections. Energy Capital Partners said in February 2022 that it had committed capital to a newly formed joint venture with Avolta to develop a series of U.S. dairy RNG projects. Public materials since then continue to describe the company as a growing dairy RNG developer with a project pipeline across major livestock regions.",
